From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] icu: Windows' combined ICU library; the shellfolders api set

Windows 10 1903 and later ship ICU as one library, icu.dll, linked by plain function names; Windows Terminal's TerminalApp.dll links to u_charType, u_countChar32, u_foldCase and u_strToUTF32 there, and WindowsTerminal.exe to the api set ext-ms-win-shell32-shellfolders-l1-1-0: neither existed and Terminal did not load. icu.dll has those four (general categories and simple case folding from the Unicode Character Database, generated by make_tables.py) and forwards the converters to icuuc; the api set is shell32's.
---
